# ============================================
# 换行符统一规则（彻底消灭 LF/CRLF 警告）
# ============================================

# 默认：自动处理，但检出时统一转为 LF（跨平台协作最佳实践）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确指定文本文件类型
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.lock text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.pyi text eol=lf
*.proto text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 明确指定二进制文件（不转换）
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.pdb binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary